<div id="body" class="mktoText" style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, Sans-Serif; padding:10px;">
<p>Hi {{lead.First Name:default=Friend}},</p> 
<div>
Your treasury peers are taking a hard look at their processes for global operations. I hear too often from treasury folks the following challenges: 
<br /> 
<ul> 
<li>Too many bank accounts needed to maintain global payments (including new bank account openings when expanding to new markets)</li> 
<li>Complex and expensive cross-border transactions</li> 
<li>Manual and time-consuming exchange rate monitoring</li> 
</ul> Flywire solves this. You can plug into 
<a href="https://www.flywire.com/platform/global-payment-network?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" id="">Flywire’s payment network</a> and eliminate unnecessary and complicated banking relationships to simplify your global payments ecosystem. With over 240 countries and 140 currencies, our payment network can accommodate use cases on a wide range of business needs. What’s more, we take on the FX burden for you. 
<br />
<br /> Schedule time with me today to learn how we can help save you and your team the hassle of opening up new bank accounts and entities. 
<br />
<br /> Thank you, 
<br />Logan Strickland
